# Content Hub images on mimic

When mimicking a site or page (or editing serialized Image fields for a vertical):

1. **Read and follow** `.cursor/skills/sitecore-serialization-skills/sitecore-content-hub-images/SKILL.md`.
2. Prefer **Content Hub** DAM Image XML (`src` + `dam-id`) when the user has CH credentials loaded.
3. If CH is unavailable, use `sitecore-media-from-url-yaml` (`mediaid`) — still download; never hotlink the reference site.
4. Before push: no reference-host URLs on Image fields; no duplicate item `ID:` values; run validate then push the module namespace.

Secrets stay in local `set-ch-env.ps1` outside git — never commit them.
